<title>USA: Pfizer sees double-digit growth in 1997. [CORRECTED 18:52 GMT]</title>
<headline>Pfizer sees double-digit growth in 1997. [CORRECTED 18:52 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pfizer Inc said Thursday it expects double-digit growth in sales and net income in 1997.</p>
<p>Pfizer reported 1996 earnings of $2.99 a share on sales of $11.3 billion, compared to $2.50 a share on sales of $10.0 billion in 1995 (corrects sales to &quot;billions&quot; from &quot;millions&quot;).</p>
<p>The company said that it anticiaptes about a 20 percent increase, to $2 billion, in research and development spending in 1997.</p>
